{
  "info": {
    "name": "BPOS API",
    "description": "Multi-tenant commerce and operations platform for Nigerian SMEs\n\n## Authentication\nAll protected endpoints require a Bearer token in the Authorization header.\n\n1. POST `/v1/auth/login` with email + password to get `accessToken` and `refreshToken`\n2. Use `{{accessToken}}` variable in the `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}` header\n3. When token expires, POST `/v1/auth/refresh` with the refresh token to get a new pair\n\n## Multi-Tenancy\nEvery authenticated request is scoped to the tenant embedded in the JWT. No `X-Tenant-ID` header is needed.\n\n## Monetary Values\nAll monetary values are stored and returned as **integer kobo** (₦1 = 100 kobo). Divide by 100 to convert to Naira.\n\n## Error Envelope\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\",\n    \"message\": \"'from' must be before 'to'\",\n    \"details\": []\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Feature Flags\nSome endpoints are gated by subscription tier. A `402` response with `FEATURE_GATED` code means the merchant's plan does not include the feature.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "Returns service status, timestamp, and environment. Unauthenticated."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"merchant@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Authenticate and receive JWT access + refresh tokens. Rate limited: 10 requests per minute."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/refresh",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Exchange a refresh token for a new access + refresh token pair. Rate limited: 10 requests per minute."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/logout",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Revoke the refresh token. The user must log in again after this."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/me",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "description": "Returns the authenticated user's profile including role, tenantId, and locationId."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tenants",
      "item": [
